const units=[
['Present Simple','V / he, she, it + V-s. Для вопроса используй do/does + подлежащее + V.','The guide usually ___ at nine.','starts','start','Does she works on Sundays?','Does she work on Sundays?','What does a typical weekend look like for you?'],
['Present Continuous','am/is/are + V-ing описывает действие в процессе сейчас.','Listen! The choir ___ in the hall.','is singing','sings','They preparing dinner right now.','They are preparing dinner right now.','Describe what people around you are doing right now.'],
['Simple vs Continuous','Привычки и состояния — Simple. Временные действия — Continuous. Know и need обычно употребляются в Simple.','I ___ the answer now.','know','am knowing','She is needing a ticket.','She needs a ticket.','What do you usually do in the evening? What are you doing differently this week?'],
['Past Simple','Для завершённого действия в прошлом используй V-ed или вторую форму. В вопросах и отрицаниях — did + начальная форма.','Last night the train ___ ten minutes late.','arrived','arrives','We did not took the bus.','We did not take the bus.','Tell me about a journey that turned out differently from your plan.'],
['Past Simple · закрепление','У неправильных глаголов особая форма: buy → bought, find → found. После did используется начальная форма.','Yesterday the volunteers ___ an old map.','found','find','Did they bought the tickets?','Did they buy the tickets?','What did you find, buy or learn on your last day out?'],
['Past Continuous','was/were + V-ing описывает процесс в конкретный момент прошлого.','At eight yesterday the children ___ outside.','were playing','are playing','The artist were painting at noon.','The artist was painting at noon.','What were people doing when you last entered a busy place?'],
['Past Simple vs Past Continuous','Для фона используй was/were + V-ing, для короткого события — Past Simple.','I was reading when the lights ___.','went out','go out','While we were eating, the phone ring.','While we were eating, the phone rang.','Describe an activity that was interrupted. What happened next?'],
['Present Perfect','have/has + past participle связывает прошлый опыт с настоящим. С законченным временем yesterday используй Past Simple.','So far this month, the team ___ three events.','has organised','organises','She has wrote two reports.','She has written two reports.','What have you learned recently? When did you first try it?'],
['Future forms','Be going to + V выражает намерение. Will + V подходит для решения, принятого сейчас.','I have already booked my seat. I ___ travel on Friday.','am going to','was','I will to call the office.','I will call the office.','What are you going to do next weekend, and why?'],
['Modal verbs','После can, should и must нужен глагол в начальной форме. Should выражает совет.','Visitors should ___ water.','bring','to bring','He can explains the route.','He can explain the route.','What advice would you give to a first-time visitor?'],
['Articles','Для первого упоминания исчисляемого предмета — a/an. Для уже известного — the.','We saw a fox. ___ fox stopped by the road.','The','An','She bought an blue umbrella.','She bought a blue umbrella.','Describe an object you found. What did the object look like?'],
['Prepositions','At с точным временем, on с днями, in с месяцами. Learn about a topic, spend time on a task.','The talk starts ___ noon.','at','in','The museum opens in Monday.','The museum opens on Monday.','When and where would you organise a public event?'],
['First Conditional','If + Present Simple, will + V — реальное условие и возможный результат.','If the weather improves, we ___ outside.','will eat','would have eaten','If it will rain, we will stay home.','If it rains, we will stay home.','How will your plans change if it rains tomorrow?'],
['Second Conditional','If + Past Simple, would + V — воображаемая ситуация сейчас или в будущем.','If I had more space, I ___ a garden.','would plant','will planting','If I knew the answer, I will tell you.','If I knew the answer, I would tell you.','If you could change one thing about your town, what would you change?']];
