['Building insulation','Insulation reduces heat transfer between indoor and outdoor spaces. Its performance depends not only on the material but also on installation quality. Gaps can allow heat to escape even when the insulation itself is effective.',[['What is the purpose of insulation?','Reducing heat transfer.','Increasing air temperature directly.','Generating electricity.'],['Why does installation quality matter?','Gaps can allow heat to escape.','All materials have identical performance.','Insulation requires direct sunlight.']]]
